WEBVTT

01:44.395 --> 01:45.688
Calm down.

01:45.772 --> 01:48.024
A morning hello is no big deal!

01:48.108 --> 01:48.942
Morning!

01:49.025 --> 01:51.152
I practiced the heck out of it last night!

01:51.236 --> 01:53.029
I got this!

01:53.113 --> 01:56.741
I can't let her catch on
that I'm a morning hello amateur!

02:14.592 --> 02:15.844
Hold on.

02:15.927 --> 02:17.679
Even though we became friends,

02:17.762 --> 02:20.265
would she suddenly start waiting for me
at the school gate?

02:20.348 --> 02:22.267
She must be waiting for someone else!

02:22.350 --> 02:23.309
Morning!

02:29.023 --> 02:31.192
The correct answer is to ignore her.

02:40.702 --> 02:42.579
You're late. Let's go.

02:57.594 --> 03:00.054
That hurt, damn you!
You're in the way, moron.

03:00.138 --> 03:03.141
Can you hurry up and move?
You're so annoying!

03:15.486 --> 03:18.656
ESS EFF - SPECIAL
A MYSTERY IN OPTICS

03:45.892 --> 03:47.352
CRAB + TURBO G
FRESHWATER CRAB?

04:10.416 --> 04:12.168
Um, excuse me.

04:12.252 --> 04:14.462
Is Miss Ayase here?

04:14.545 --> 04:16.839
Huh? Who? I can't hear you.

04:17.465 --> 04:19.425
It's lunchtime,
so maybe he's at the cafeteria?

04:19.509 --> 04:21.552
Like Okarun would go
to such a rowdy place!

04:21.636 --> 04:22.887
He's at the co-op. The co-op!

04:22.971 --> 04:24.222
Co-op?

04:25.056 --> 04:27.475
I'll drop by after I check the cafeteria.

04:36.693 --> 04:39.529
TSUKEMEN

04:42.573 --> 04:45.702
She's not here. I should try the co-op.

04:47.870 --> 04:50.373
I guess I'll try the cafeteria.

04:51.249 --> 04:54.127
TSUKEMEN

04:57.171 --> 04:58.381
Nowhere to be found.

04:58.464 --> 04:59.882
Nowhere to be found.

05:03.636 --> 05:05.221
She's avoiding me.

05:05.305 --> 05:08.349
She realized this morning how boring I am

05:08.433 --> 05:10.268
and must've thought
that I'm a pain in the butt.

05:10.351 --> 05:13.396
Sheesh, where are you, Okarun?

05:13.479 --> 05:15.982
Lunch break is gonna be over soon!

05:16.899 --> 05:18.776
This is the worst.

05:20.778 --> 05:24.240
Come to think,
he was pretty lifeless this morning.

05:24.741 --> 05:27.910
Maybe he doesn't like people
getting in his face?

05:27.994 --> 05:32.081
Maybe I wasn't earnestly thinking
about Okarun's feelings.

05:32.957 --> 05:39.422
Miss Ayase has so many friends,
so I guess I'm just a friend candidate.

05:44.635 --> 05:48.765
Maybe I don't even count as a friend.

06:09.452 --> 06:11.537
I was conceited.

06:11.621 --> 06:13.623
I'm totes feelin' the blues.

06:13.706 --> 06:15.917
Why am I always like this?

06:16.000 --> 06:18.628
Why am I such a wimp?

06:20.171 --> 06:21.089
I'm sorry.

06:21.172 --> 06:22.590
I'm sorry, Okarun.

08:06.152 --> 08:10.031
A MYSTERY IN OPTICS

08:20.625 --> 08:22.585
ESS EFF

09:06.003 --> 09:09.799
I must resort to power and cunning.

09:10.508 --> 09:12.969
That way, I will win!

09:21.811 --> 09:23.271
I see you.

09:23.354 --> 09:25.064
I see you, my enemy.

09:28.276 --> 09:29.652
I'm talking to you.

09:29.735 --> 09:33.614
What?! W-What's this about?
Why are you talking to me?

09:33.698 --> 09:36.576
I'm not interested in guys,
but I have no choice.

09:38.911 --> 09:40.037
How is it possible

09:40.121 --> 09:43.332
for you to get along so well
with Miss Momo Ayase?

09:44.333 --> 09:45.960
- Huh?
- It's strange.

09:46.043 --> 09:49.338
You're not particularly handsome.
You're short and quite dull.

09:49.422 --> 09:52.675
But you're always
being chummy with Momo Ayase.

09:53.384 --> 09:55.928
And as of late, Miss Shiratori as well.

09:56.012 --> 09:57.888
Tell me how you do it!

09:57.972 --> 09:59.932
How are you popular
with all the beautiful girls?

10:00.016 --> 10:02.560
No, I'm not popular at all!

10:02.643 --> 10:03.644
Okarun!

10:03.728 --> 10:05.104
Found it, Okarun!

10:05.187 --> 10:06.689
The other family jewel!

10:06.772 --> 10:08.024
What the?

10:08.566 --> 10:10.568
Sorry! Was I interrupting?

10:10.651 --> 10:16.949
Oh no, we weren't talking about much,
so it's not a nuisance at all.

10:17.033 --> 10:18.701
Okarun, is this your friend?

10:18.784 --> 10:22.455
Oh, well, each person has
a different definition of friendship,

10:22.538 --> 10:25.207
so if you say we're friends,
then I suppose we are.

10:25.791 --> 10:28.836
Really? Cool! Be good to Okarun, okay?

10:31.505 --> 10:33.299
Anyway, there was a golden ball!

10:33.382 --> 10:34.425
A great adventure?

10:34.508 --> 10:36.719
Miss Ayase, let's talk about that outside.

10:36.802 --> 10:38.179
I got it!

10:38.262 --> 10:41.932
The secret to being popular is spicy talk!

10:42.850 --> 10:44.769
Um, excuse me.

10:45.436 --> 10:47.855
You're in Class B, right?

10:47.938 --> 10:52.652
Can you please stop visiting
other classes so often?

10:53.235 --> 10:55.279
Some people want to study,

10:55.363 --> 10:58.115
and it's a nuisance
for you to run around like this.

10:59.450 --> 11:02.787
Oh, sorry. I'll be more careful!

11:03.663 --> 11:05.831
Okay, Okarun, let's head outside!

11:05.915 --> 11:06.832
Okay!

11:06.916 --> 11:09.794
Takakura, there's no need
to go reluctantly!

11:11.003 --> 11:14.048
If you can't tell her,
I'll tell her for you!

11:14.548 --> 11:16.092
Huh? Is that true?

11:16.175 --> 11:17.551
No, it's not.

11:18.219 --> 11:19.720
What's this about?

11:20.304 --> 11:22.390
Hey, he's saying that's not the case.

11:22.473 --> 11:25.393
If you're right there,
he'll be too scared to say anything!

11:25.476 --> 11:28.521
Takakura, I'm sorry
that I didn't notice until now.

11:28.604 --> 11:31.440
I'm the class president,
so you can tell me anything!

11:31.524 --> 11:32.733
No, um...

11:33.234 --> 11:36.320
Hey, Okarun, can you tell her
that she's an idiot?

11:36.404 --> 11:37.863
I was just about to say--

11:37.947 --> 11:39.532
Don't intimidate him!

11:40.074 --> 11:41.700
You shut up for a bit!

11:41.784 --> 11:43.702
You shouldn't be shouting so loudly!

11:43.786 --> 11:45.996
Let me talk!

11:46.080 --> 11:49.041
Damn it! He's so popular!

11:49.125 --> 11:52.169
When? What timing
do I need to cut in to be popular?

11:52.253 --> 11:53.921
Now? She's cute.

11:54.004 --> 11:55.798
Now? So cute.

11:55.881 --> 11:57.174
Now!

11:57.925 --> 11:59.218
Ten gallon weenie.

12:01.971 --> 12:04.098
Don't give up, Kinta.

12:09.812 --> 12:10.646
Wiener.

12:11.355 --> 12:13.399
Do you wanna die?

12:22.450 --> 12:25.161
What's with that skank?
She really pisses me off!

12:25.244 --> 12:28.289
What does she even know about you, Okarun?

12:28.372 --> 12:33.711
I had so many things coming at me
all at once and I couldn't react.

12:33.794 --> 12:39.592
But I was happy because people in my class
never really talked to me until now.

12:39.675 --> 12:41.844
Maybe it's because
you're pretty cool lately.

12:41.927 --> 12:43.471
Huh? R-Really?

12:44.722 --> 12:45.556
Yeah.

12:47.683 --> 12:49.268
Hurray.

12:50.686 --> 12:51.770
Are you all right?

12:52.271 --> 12:54.356
What was with that "hurray"?

12:55.065 --> 12:56.442
Cracks me up.

12:56.525 --> 12:58.777
Then what was I supposed to say?

13:01.113 --> 13:04.116
That's fine. It's so like you, Okarun!

13:07.077 --> 13:08.704
Anyway, the family jewels!

13:08.787 --> 13:10.414
You saw Miko's picture, right?

13:10.498 --> 13:11.707
Yes, I saw it!

13:14.126 --> 13:17.213
It looked like the space
around the golden ball was warped.

13:17.296 --> 13:20.299
It seems like an orb or a fireball.

13:20.382 --> 13:22.760
Maybe a spirit
was in the middle of transporting

13:22.843 --> 13:24.929
the family jewels somewhere.

13:25.012 --> 13:28.641
Turbo Granny did say
that other spirits would want it, too.

13:29.517 --> 13:32.603
They are definitely
talking about something spicy.

13:32.686 --> 13:33.562
Why?

13:33.646 --> 13:38.734
Why is Takakura's spicy talk okay,
but mine is worthy of death?

13:38.817 --> 13:39.944
I wanna know!

13:40.027 --> 13:42.488
I wanna gain that technique!

13:42.571 --> 13:46.075
How can he get away
with spicy talk so naturally like that?

13:46.158 --> 13:49.787
And I wanna be lovey-dovey
with beautiful girls like Miss Momo Ayase!

13:49.870 --> 13:51.705
- Wanna try going that way?
- No, I will!

13:53.082 --> 13:56.210
But still, what are they doing
in a place like this?

13:56.752 --> 13:59.547
It doesn't seem like
they live in this housing complex.

14:03.133 --> 14:06.053
Uh, w-what a coincidence!

14:06.136 --> 14:08.973
We went the same way home from school.

14:11.141 --> 14:12.142
Huh?

14:16.021 --> 14:20.317
At this rate, Miss Ayase's lips
and mine will touch.

14:23.028 --> 14:25.990
How did things end up this way?

14:26.073 --> 14:28.534
It's that perv from your class, Okarun!

14:28.617 --> 14:31.120
Is he the true form
of the family jewel spirit?

14:31.203 --> 14:32.830
Momo-chan! Over there!

14:39.169 --> 14:41.046
Family jewels! Gotta catch 'em all!

14:41.130 --> 14:42.214
What a bummer.

14:45.843 --> 14:46.886
So fast!

14:52.349 --> 14:53.225
Okarun!

14:53.309 --> 14:55.853
Momo-chan, this isn't a ghost at all.

14:56.770 --> 14:58.981
It has a physical body.

14:59.064 --> 15:02.985
There's definitely someone there!

15:07.406 --> 15:09.116
Momo-chan, be careful.

15:09.199 --> 15:11.118
I can't see it,
but there's something there.

15:12.161 --> 15:13.621
Oh! It ran away!

15:13.704 --> 15:15.122
Momo-chan, hop on!

15:15.205 --> 15:16.874
What's going on with that thing?

15:17.583 --> 15:19.043
It turned left up there!

15:19.126 --> 15:21.629
Oh! He's giving her
a piggyback ride! I'm jealous!

15:21.712 --> 15:24.924
Hey, Perv! Watch our backpacks!

15:25.007 --> 15:26.592
If you lose them, I'll butcher ya!

15:26.675 --> 15:27.927
Bra-ger that!

15:28.010 --> 15:30.888
Now I'm definitely going to butcher you.

15:30.971 --> 15:32.306
Why is that?

15:32.389 --> 15:34.767
What part of my spicy talk
is unacceptable?

15:34.850 --> 15:36.727
Spicy talk in general is disgusting!

15:36.810 --> 15:38.103
Get back here, family jewels!

15:38.187 --> 15:40.648
You're saying it!
You're saying spicy stuff!

15:46.236 --> 15:48.280
Crap, I lost sight of it!

15:57.081 --> 15:58.123
Momo-chan!

16:02.795 --> 16:03.629
Damn you!

16:04.171 --> 16:07.132
Ugh, what's with that thing?
It's running like crazy!

16:19.395 --> 16:20.270
All right!

16:27.486 --> 16:28.779
Okarun!

16:28.862 --> 16:31.323
Momo-chan! That thing fell down.

16:31.407 --> 16:33.283
Okarun, grab onto me!

16:33.367 --> 16:34.201
Are you sure?

16:34.284 --> 16:35.411
It's fine!

16:45.087 --> 16:45.921
There it is!

17:02.312 --> 17:04.732
Okarun, are you okay?

17:04.815 --> 17:09.653
Hold on just a sec. I can't breathe.

17:11.864 --> 17:14.241
Sorry, I was reckless!

17:16.702 --> 17:18.829
No, it's all right.

17:21.165 --> 17:23.000
This is bad.

17:23.083 --> 17:27.880
I didn't think I was this powerless
when I can't see the opponent.

17:28.756 --> 17:30.841
Same for me.

17:30.924 --> 17:33.052
More like, isn't that thing cheating?

17:33.135 --> 17:34.970
What's with this invisibility crap?

17:35.596 --> 17:37.806
- Come on, now.
- Not fair!

17:41.977 --> 17:43.937
Wasn't that the perv?

17:44.021 --> 17:45.564
Did he follow us?

17:45.647 --> 17:46.648
This is terrible!

17:48.859 --> 17:50.736
Momo-chan, what's the plan?

17:50.819 --> 17:53.781
None! Priority is to save the perv!

17:55.616 --> 17:58.535
Wait, hold it right there!

18:02.289 --> 18:03.582
Oh, so amazing!

18:03.665 --> 18:05.959
You saved me! Thank you!
I want to hug you!

18:06.043 --> 18:07.753
You dumbass, don't follow us!

18:07.836 --> 18:10.089
And what happened to our backpacks?

18:10.172 --> 18:11.423
Momo-chan, it's coming!

18:14.176 --> 18:17.888
I will have you tell me later
exactly what you two are.

18:17.971 --> 18:19.139
Leave this to me!

18:19.223 --> 18:21.100
I'm tellin' ya to get lost
cuz you're in the way!

18:23.435 --> 18:24.353
Let's go!

18:24.436 --> 18:26.855
Jet Stream Attack!

18:27.940 --> 18:29.650
That didn't do anything!

18:29.733 --> 18:31.110
What a bummer.

18:31.193 --> 18:33.445
Look at it from three directions!

18:33.529 --> 18:36.990
It's highly likely that it's using
retro-reflective projection technology!

19:12.484 --> 19:13.402
I see it!

19:16.613 --> 19:17.614
Got it!

19:17.698 --> 19:19.575
Okarun, aim for this spot!

19:24.329 --> 19:26.206
Going full throttle!

19:37.676 --> 19:39.052
Nice, Okarun.

19:39.136 --> 19:40.262
Nice, Miss Ayase.

19:40.345 --> 19:42.014
Nice job to you, too.

19:42.097 --> 19:44.266
How'd you figure out
that thing's weakness?

19:45.767 --> 19:49.104
I thought the invisibility
was from optical camouflage.

19:50.981 --> 19:52.107
ESS EFF
A MYSTERY IN OPTICS

19:52.191 --> 19:54.151
That's elemental for sci-fi.

19:54.234 --> 19:56.320
By detecting the imagery
the opponent is seeing,

19:56.403 --> 19:59.114
you project that image
on the suit you're wearing

19:59.198 --> 20:01.408
to make it seem
like your body is invisible.

20:01.491 --> 20:04.870
But it doesn't work unless you accurately
project in your opponent's line of sight.

20:04.953 --> 20:08.373
In this situation with multiple angles,
it's completely ineffective.

20:08.999 --> 20:10.751
Okarun, this guy...

20:10.834 --> 20:11.835
This is...

20:11.919 --> 20:12.753
Wuh?

20:22.638 --> 20:24.806
What is that? It's not a ghost!

20:24.890 --> 20:26.266
A kaiju!

20:26.350 --> 20:28.018
Okarun, what is that thing?

20:28.101 --> 20:29.686
I have no idea!

20:29.770 --> 20:33.065
What happened to the golden ball
that we defeated thanks to my hint?

20:33.148 --> 20:36.401
You dumbass! Stop with the spicy talk
at every opportunity! It's gross!

20:36.485 --> 20:37.527
I'm sorry!

20:37.611 --> 20:40.030
But I welcome this physical contact.

20:41.365 --> 20:44.243
We were able to see the family jewels
when it was invisible.

20:44.326 --> 20:46.245
Right now,
isn't the family jewel-ness all gone?

20:46.328 --> 20:47.162
Indeed.

20:47.246 --> 20:49.957
Hey! What's different
about my spicy jokes?

20:50.040 --> 20:50.958
Come on!

20:51.041 --> 20:54.878
It's not moving for now,
so let's go down there and check it out.

21:00.634 --> 21:04.888
Takakura, can you tell me?
How do you make spicy talk work?

21:05.389 --> 21:07.057
It's better not to say it.

21:07.891 --> 21:11.186
Damn it, you've been so annoying
with spicy this, spicy that!

21:11.270 --> 21:12.229
I'm so happy!

21:13.480 --> 21:14.690
Miss Ayase!

23:38.500 --> 23:41.419
In any case, why are they all
repeatedly making spicy comments,

23:41.503 --> 23:43.588
but only mine are deemed disgusting?

23:43.672 --> 23:46.633
Is it that my spicy jokes are a bit old?

23:46.716 --> 23:48.301
Next episode, "Hey, it's a Kaiju."

23:48.385 --> 23:51.638
Are you saying there's a state-of-the-art
tool that goes beyond current technology?

23:51.721 --> 23:52.931
No, but wait!
